{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 40","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A watch loses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/326ffd5dad575b516107379241a09d601078a88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> minutes per day. It is set right at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> P.M. on March 15. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the positive correction, in minutes, to be added to the time shown by the watch at a given time. When the watch shows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> A.M. on March 21, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/11473cd606badc3ee5523daa725372dbd1f8e697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }14\\frac{14}{23}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }14\\frac{1}{14}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }13\\frac{101}{115}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }13\\frac{83}{115}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }13\\frac{13}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"526\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From March 15 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> P.M. on the watch to March 21 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> A.M. on the watch, the watch passed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/0/9108b439b091f0bf93f50045936386d79bcc583f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 + 5 \\times 24 = 140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" /> hours. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> watch hour equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd9a333fd3e4c5d52e75e79aceac68026c0b3220.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{23 + \\frac{57.5}{60}} = \\frac{576}{575}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" /> real hour, the difference between the watch time and the actual time passed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7062316341be72b43c5aa6e0f2e04470ead5b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140 \\times \\left( \\frac{576}{575} - 1 \\right) = \\frac{28}{115}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"196\" height=\"45\" /> hour <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a1b2b9e1c78f7c468bf17be45386fb74f8c76e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=14\\frac{14}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" /> minutes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.ph